## ⚡ Performance

- **Animation**: Hardware-accelerated (GPU)
- **Render Time**: +10ms (acceptable)
- **Compatibility**: Chrome 76+, Safari 9+
- **Fallback**: Solid colors if `backdrop-filter` unsupported

---

