### Before
- Static dark background
- Solid metric cards
- Plain white text
- Standard transitions

### After
- ✨ Animated gradient background
- 🪟 Glassmorphism everywhere
- 🌈 Gradient text & numbers
- 🎭 Micro-interactions on all elements

